{"name":"Single Page","description":"Arrange a complete story in sections down one scrolling page · A single-page layout guides visitors through a sequence such as value, proof, features, pricing, and action. It works when the story has one main goal. Clear sections and anchor navigation help, but important content should not depend on scroll effects. Know first Navbar Hero CTA Footer","quote":"Put everything on one long page so people can just scroll through it.","agentPrompt":"Organize the landing page as one scrolling sequence: problem, value, product evidence, customer proof, and CTA. Give sections stable anchors and long-page return paths, and repeat the same primary action only at useful decision stages.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-single-page-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Single Page</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">Put everything on one long page so people can just scroll through it.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Arrange a complete story in sections down one scrolling page</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A single-page layout guides visitors through a sequence such as value, proof, features, pricing, and action. It works when the story has one main goal. Clear sections and anchor navigation help, but important content should not depend on scroll effects.</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"Know first\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">Know first</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/navbar?lang=en\" data-ref=\"navbar\">Navbar</a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/hero?lang=en\" data-ref=\"hero\">Hero</a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/cta?lang=en\" data-ref=\"cta\">CTA</a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/footer?lang=en\" data-ref=\"footer\">Footer</a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\"><span></span><em>Single Page Layout</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"single-site-demo\">\n    <div class=\"single-site-browser\">\n      <div class=\"single-site-chrome\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>vibeflow.app</span></div>\n      <div class=\"single-site-page\">\n        <nav class=\"single-site-nav\"><b>VibeFlow</b><span>Features Cases Pricing</span><em>Start for free</em></nav>\n        <section class=\"single-site-hero\">\n          <small>AI WORKSPACE</small>\n          <strong>Turn inspiration into real products</strong>\n          <p>Describe your idea, and AI will help you design, build and launch it. </p>\n          <button>Start for free <span>→</span></button>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-features\">\n          <div><i>✦</i><b>One sentence generation</b><span>Start directly from the idea</span></div>\n          <div><i>⌘</i><b>Change while chatting</b><span>Collaborate like a partner</span></div>\n          <div><i>↗</i><b>One-click publishing</b><span>Get public URL</span></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-proof\"><span><b>Credible evidence</b> requires the use of authorized, verifiable information</span><i>Customer A Customer B Customer C</i></section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-final\"><div><b>Start creating your first product</b><span>Start for free, no credit card required</span></div><button>Create now</button></section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">You can say this to an AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>Organize the landing page as one scrolling sequence: problem, value, product evidence, customer proof, and CTA. Give sections stable anchors and long-page return paths, and repeat the same primary action only at useful decision stages.</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>When to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Product landing page</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;border-left:2px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Product features</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Pricing</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--brand);\"><i style=\"position:absolute;left:-2px;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:2px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></i>Customer reviews</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">FAQ</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Campaign page</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:stretch\"><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">Core value</span><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">Key benefits</span><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border:1px solid var(--brand)\">Next</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Portfolio story</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">Core value</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">Key benefits</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">Credible evidence</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">Next</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">A focused site with one main conversion goal</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;border-left:2px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Install</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--brand);\"><i style=\"position:absolute;left:-2px;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:2px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></i>Quick start</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">API</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">FAQ</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Scroll to “Quick start” and the table of contents highlights it automatically</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Force a large multi-purpose product into one endless page</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:10px;height:56px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:99px\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;right:2px;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red)\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:130px\">The long page lacks anchors and a back-to-top entry point.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Hide content behind complex scroll animation</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"width:76px;height:46px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;padding:3px;border:1.5px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg)\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Value</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Benefits</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Evidence</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Pricing</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">FAQ</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Next</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Repeat the same action after every short paragraph</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-input\"><em>🔍 Search usernames</em></span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">Create user</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">Alex Chen</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">Admin</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">Maya Lee</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">Members</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Use sections with no clear narrative order</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:stretch\"><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">Value</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">Benefits</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">Benefits</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border:1px solid var(--brand)\">Next</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"single-wire single-anat\"><span clas