e-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;justify-content:center\"><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--brand)\"></i><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover)\"></i><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover)\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">There are many paragraphs and you need to jump at any time</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Pure Scroll</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"single-wire\" style=\"width:74px\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen hook\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">A small landing page finished in three or four screens</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">BackTop</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block\"><span class=\"single-wire\" style=\"width:74px\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen hook\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span><span style=\"position:absolute;right:-8px;bottom:6px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">↑</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">The page is long and a quick entry to return to the top needs to be provided.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">Typical use cases</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div cla